e":"2026-05-17","motion":"Third reading Passed as amended","result":"pass","chamber":"Senate","counts":{"yes":40,"no":27}}],"documents":[],"dataAsOf":"2026-11-01","aiSummary":"The bill would require health plans to cover home care nursing for people who are also on medical assistance, and it would bar plans from setting quantity limits on that coverage. It also says the state should not make payments to cover those benefits and must help support full coverage in the private market. Health plans would have to use the term \"home care nursing services\" for these services in their plan documents. The first two parts would apply back to January 1, 2026, and the labeling rule would start August 1, 2026.","aiSummaryBasis":"bill text","aiSummaryModel":"gpt-5.4-mini","aiSummaryGenerated":"2026-11-05","aiSummaryThin":false},"MN-2025-HF5156":{"id":"MN-2025-HF5156","passed":false,"number":"HF 5156","title":"Price for prescription drugs subject to the Medicare Drug Price Negotiation Program established.","summary":null,"summarySource":null,"introduced":"2026-05-17","sponsor":{"name":"Howard","party":"Democratic-Farmer-Labor","state":"MN","district":"51A"},"cosponsors":[{"name":"Youakim","party":"Democratic-Farmer-Labor","state":"MN","date":null,"withdrawn":false},{"name":"Finke","party":"Democratic-Farmer-Labor","state":"MN","date":null,"withdrawn":false},{"name":"Elkins","party":"Democratic-Farmer-Labor","state":"MN","date":null,"withdrawn":false},{"name":"Mahamoud","party":"Democratic-Farmer-Labor","state":"MN","date":null,"withdrawn":false},{"name":"Cha","party":"Democratic-Farmer-Labor","state":"MN","date":null,"withdrawn":false},{"name":"Reyer","party":"Democratic-Farmer-Labor","state":"MN","date":null,"withdrawn":false},{"name":"Bahner","party":"Democratic-Farmer-Labor","state":"MN","date":null,"withdrawn":false},{"name":"Tabke","party":"Democratic-Farmer-Labor","state":"MN","date":null,"withdrawn":false},{"name":"Norris","party":"Democratic-Farmer-Labor","state":"MN","d